            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda akoba ati: “Bona eno, mu kiseera ekyo kyene ndireetera abantu b'omu Buyudaaya n'ab'omu Yerusalemu, ebintu byairamu okubajiiranga obukalamu kabiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndisoloza abamaghanga goonagoona, naabatwala mu kyetebwa Ekiiko kya Yehoshafati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:2:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yehoshafati:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Eriina eryo litegeeza “Musengwa Katonda alamula”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Era nga bali eyo, ndibasalira omusango olw'ebyo bye baakola ku bantu bange Abaisiraeli kuba baabasansaaniza eyo mu maghanga, era baagabana ensi yange Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakubira obululu ku bantu bange, baaghaayo abalenzi okusasulira abakazi bamalaaya, era baaghaayo abaghala okubagulamu omwenge, era baagunhwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
