                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Muli kugezaaku kunkola ki, imwe ab'e Tiro, n'ab'e Sidoni, n'ab'omu biketezo by'e Filisitia? Ghaligho kye muli kwenda okuneesasuulizaaku? Oba nga ekyo kye muli kwenda, nze mwene ndibeesasuulizaaku imwe amangu n'embiro, olw'ebikolwa byaimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olw'okuba mwatoola feeza wange ni zaabu wange, mwatoola n'eby'obukombe byange, mwabitwala mu masabo gaimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwatoola abantu b'omu Buyudaaya n'ab'omu Yerusalemu mu nsi yaibwe, mwabatwaliriza eghala, mwabaguza Abagureki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye mperaano nja kuleetera abantu abo okuva eyo ye mwabatunda, olwo mwena mbeesasuulizeeku nga mbakola kyene ekyo kye mwabakola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndidha kuleetera batabane baimwe ni baghala baimwe okutundibwa mu Bayudaaya. Ate boona bamale babaguze Abasabea, eighanga eriri eyo eghala einho. Nze Musengwa Katonda, ninze nkobye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
